# Without the kind predicate, the list ignores the filter and answers the wrong rows.

title: the kind filter is bound and then ignored
file: internal/ledger/balance.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestTheListNarrowsToAKind -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
		    AND (nullif($2::text, '') IS NULL OR kind::text = $2::text)
--- after
		    AND (nullif($2::text, '') IS NULL OR true)
